_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0488","start":488,"end":490,"surface":"絳侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0493","start":493,"end":494,"surface":"昭","kind":"person","person_id":"0l7_ynh_g9v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0502","start":502,"end":504,"surface":"薄昭","kind":"person","person_id":"0l7_ynh_g9v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0518","start":518,"end":520,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0523","start":523,"end":525,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0536","start":536,"end":538,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0541","start":541,"end":543,"surface":"張武","kind":"person","person_id":"3sp_xmg_o87","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0560","start":560,"end":562,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p007","text":"壬子，遣車騎將軍薄昭迎皇太后於代。皇帝曰：「呂產自置為相國，呂祿為上將軍，擅矯遣灌將軍嬰將兵擊齊，欲代劉氏，嬰留滎陽弗擊，與諸侯合謀以誅呂氏。呂產欲為不善，丞相陳平與太尉周勃謀奪呂產等軍。朱虛侯劉章首先捕呂產等。太尉身率襄平侯通持節承詔入北軍。典客劉揭身奪趙王呂祿印。益封太尉勃萬戶，賜金五千斤。丞相陳平、灌將軍嬰邑各三千戶，金二千斤。朱虛侯劉章、襄平侯通、東牟侯劉興居邑各二千戶，金千斤。封典客揭為陽信侯，賜金千斤。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m007-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"薄昭","kind":"person","person_id":"0l7_ynh_g9v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m007-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"皇太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或匿名指代待覆核