kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或神祇指稱未定；不補未見姓名或血親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m009-0318","start":318,"end":320,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m009-0376","start":376,"end":378,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m009-0400","start":400,"end":402,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m009-0411","start":411,"end":413,"surface":"子某","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m009-0425","start":425,"end":427,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m009-0429","start":429,"end":430,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m009-0451","start":451,"end":453,"surface":"薄昭","kind":"person","person_id":"0l7_ynh_g9v","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p008","text":"高祖崩，諸御幸姬戚夫人之屬，呂太后怒，皆幽之，不得出宮。而薄姬以希見故，得出，從子之代，為代王太后。太后弟薄昭從如代。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"rz8_ti9_xt5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"戚夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"jgf_03h_m8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"呂太后","kind":"person","person_id":"trv_ybp_bes","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"薄姬","kind":"person","person_id":"9zj_vf7_86a_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"9zj_vf7_86a_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"9zj_vf7_86a_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"薄昭","kind":"person","person_id":"8gp_odm_2fn","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p009","text":"代王立十七年，高后崩。大臣議立後，疾外家呂氏彊，皆稱薄氏仁善，故迎代王，立為孝文皇帝，而太后改號曰皇太后，弟薄昭封為軹侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"lfn_6kn_o3b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"trv_ybp_bes","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"lfn_6kn_o3b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0038","start":38,"end":42,"surface":"孝文皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"lfn_6kn_o3b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"9zj_vf7_86a_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或待核稱謂；不由熟悉生平補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"薄昭","kind":"person","person_id":"8gp_odm_2fn","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p010","text":"歲餘，每河東守尉行縣至絳，絳侯勃自畏恐誅，常被甲，令家人持兵以見之。其後人有上書告勃欲反，下廷尉。廷尉下其事長安，逮捕勃治之。勃恐，不知置辭。吏稍侵辱之。勃以千金與獄吏，獄吏乃書牘背示之，曰「以公主為證」。公主者，孝文帝女也，勃太子勝之尚之，故獄吏教引為證。勃之益封受賜，盡以予薄昭。及系急，薄昭為言薄太后，太后亦以為無反事。文帝朝，太后以冒絮提文帝，曰：「絳侯綰皇帝璽，將兵於北軍，不以此時反，今居一小縣，顧欲反邪！」文帝既見絳侯獄辭，乃謝曰：「吏［事］方驗而出之。」於是使使持節赦絳侯，復爵邑。絳侯既出，曰：「吾嘗將百萬軍，然安知獄吏之貴乎！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"河東守尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"絳侯勃","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"家人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"廷尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"廷尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"獄吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057